OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA mostly dry day with variable
OL,6,Fcloud and some bright or sunny spells.
OL,7,FPerhaps the odd shower in places.
OL,8,FRemaining rather chilly with light or
OL,9,Fmoderate easterly winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FLargely dry with long clear
OL,12,Fspells developing. Turning cold with a
OL,13,Ffairly widespread frost and some
OL,14,Fpatches of mist or fog possible.
OL,15,
OL,16,CMonday:FAny early mist or fog clearing
OL,17,Fto leave a largely dry and bright day
OL,18,Fwith sunny spells. Remaining rather
OL,19,Fchilly with generally light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
