OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,6,FCloudier through Tuesday with
OL,7,Fstrengthening winds and rain arriving
OL,8,Fin places. Cloudy, breezy with some
OL,9,Frain on Wednesday. Thursday probably
OL,10,Fdrier but mainly cloudy. Temperatures
OL,11,Fnear or just below average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
